{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced, dark apocalypse style zombie shooter game that is relatively challenging. Players need to survive in this dangerous ghost place, concentrate their attention and reaction, and move flexibly for shooting. Close combat weapons can withstand monster bullets, and every time they eliminate zombies, there is a chance to drop the weapon random pack. Obtaining the weapon random pack can give players super weapons such as fireworks, experiencing the thrill of defeating monsters with super weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end has arrived, leaving behind a wasteland of chaos. Mutated and frenzied zombies lurk everywhere, fraught with danger. You must utilize available weapons and special magic to fight back and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/695a4d966bbb6af186533716e9bbaab6.poster.avif?t=1769250035\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/695a4d966bbb6af186533716e9bbaab6.webm?t=1769250035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/695a4d966bbb6af186533716e9bbaab6.mp4?t=1769250035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pace is fast!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate gaming sensation!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super weapons randomly drop (flamethrower, various fireworks weapons, lightning launcher, berserk fireball, ...)!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Magic Random Drops (Fire Dragon Roar, Meteor Magic, Lightning Magic Array, ...)!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee weapons can block enemy bullets!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy assault will continue until the end. Try to eliminate as many enemies as possible and survive during this period!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/8bb33b5239603ad6618a93d580a45c9b.poster.avif?t=1769250035\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/8bb33b5239603ad6618a93d580a45c9b.webm?t=1769250035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/8bb33b5239603ad6618a93d580a45c9b.mp4?t=1769250035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959110/c95e140d93b6cdfdbd586d5f8d298f9e1b59bfb4.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959110?t=1769250035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/42e791b2db1f0e0b43626f6717b04aad706f5850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769250035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/1f2d7a568a87ef8a1c0e2d211d6925381bdac66d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769250035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/1f2d7a568a87ef8a1c0e2d211d6925381bdac66d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769250035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descrip