!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee weapons can block enemy bullets!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy assault will continue until the end. Try to eliminate as many enemies as possible and survive during this period!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/8bb33b5239603ad6618a93d580a45c9b.poster.avif?t=1769250035\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/8bb33b5239603ad6618a93d580a45c9b.webm?t=1769250035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/8bb33b5239603ad6618a93d580a45c9b.mp4?t=1769250035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Aeon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/6ae79cd7581e63d3012f93be11891ea28b017aee/header.jpg?t=1769250035","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959110/1518383849/961d3a23508e78f23e316dc99d4c235055e62d8b/1766657586/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766658109","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959110/1518383849/961d3a23508e78f23e316dc99d4c235055e62d8b/1766657586/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766658109","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959110/1518383849/961d3a23508e78f23e316dc99d4c235055e62d8b/1766657586/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766658109","id":257215695,"name":"DoomDawn